# Plans

Write every plan for this workspace in [`.cursor/plans/`](../plans/) at this repository root.

- Plan mode files belong here, including `*.plan.md`.
- Do not leave a plan in the home directory (`~/.cursor/plans`). If Cursor creates one there, move it into this repository's `.cursor/plans/` before the planning turn ends.
- Do not write plans into another product or the parent Grav install.
- Use a short descriptive filename. Leave a plan untouched when the user says it is read-only.
